  "35.Weather Concerns (synopsis of current and predictedweather; discuss related factors that may cause concern):": "92°F, 11% relative humidity, Southwest winds at 18 mph gusting to 30 mph. Red Flag Warning active until 22:00 PDT.",
  "36.Projected Incident Activity, Potential, Movement, Escalation, or Spread and influencing factors during the next operationalperiod and in 12hour timeframes": "Expected to breach Ridge Line 4 and push toward Ward Creek.",
