  "36.Projected Incident Activity, Potential, Movement, Escalation, or Spread and influencing factors during the next operationalperiod and in 48hour timeframes": "May cross Highway 89 if winds persist.",
  "36.Projected Incident Activity, Potential, Movement, Escalation, or Spread and influencing factors during the next operationalperiod and in 72hour timeframes": "Expected growth to 6,000 acres.",
  "36.Projected Incident Activity, Potential, Movement, Escalation, or Spread and influencing factors during the next operational period and anticipated after 72hour timeframes": "",
